+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+"""B70 v7 candidate, CPU tests.
+
+    TRITON_INTERPRET=1 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES= \
+        pytest -q --noconftest tests/v1/core/test_b70_v7.py
+
+1. KV8 (B70_DFLASH_KV_INT8): the KV-only int8 GEMM gives the per-layer qkv
+   path's K/V bit for bit; refusals log and keep the old path.
+2. DFA (B70_DRAFT_FA_INT8): non-causal sliding-window draft blocks take the
+   INT8 decode call with window [w, 0] from the block end; deviation from the
+   per-row TRITON_ATTN window measured; backend override and its refusals.
+3. K4F (B70_PTH_FA_PREFILL_FAST): one-launch dequant equals _dequant_blocks
+   bit for bit; the fast prefill equals the stock loop bit for bit.
+4. AUX (B70_DFLASH2_AUX_REUSE): hc_combine_norm's materialized state equals
+   hc_combine bit for bit; deferred capture keeps the feature order.
+5. PLEG (B70_PLE_DEVICE_GATHER): the Triton n-gram hash equals the host hash;
+   the device gather equals the host stage (multi-slab, padding, split heads).
+"""
